      "id": "emergent_sovereign_stack_fracture",
      "description": "The audit of the EU's sovereign AI stack reveals deep interoperability failures between national systems, particularly in telemetry, secure communication, and failover protocols. These gaps are now being exploited in low-level cyber probes, exposing critical weaknesses in the Union's coordinated response capacity. The fracture undermines trust in the EU-wide architecture and accelerates member-state fragmentation.",
